{
  "_about": "Words, phrases and shapes that read as machine-written. quality.py rejects any generated post that uses one, and llm_content.py tells the model not to. Calibrated against the curated library: every item in content/linkedin.json and content/instagram.json passes clean. Keep it that way when adding entries (python quality.py --library must report 0 issues).",
